[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2537015029","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100291#issuecomment-2537015029","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100291","id":2537015029,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XN8b1","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-11T20:13:01Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T20:13:01Z","body":"That's because this isn't a GDscript warning. This is a an internal warning that is telling you that you are doing something wrong. You _need_ to wait on task completion before destroying a thread. If you don't, you risk destroying the thread before it finishes the task you have started.\n\nMost likely you have gotten lucky and the task has finished before you destroyed the thread, but what you have now is a race condition that just hasn't totally broken your game. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2537015029/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2537305839","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100291#issuecomment-2537305839","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100291","id":2537305839,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XPDbv","user":{"login":"ScottUlmer","id":29180106,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTgwMTA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29180106?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottUlmer","html_url":"https://github.com/ScottUlmer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottUlmer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottUlmer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottUlmer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottUlmer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottUlmer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottUlmer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottUlmer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottUlmer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottUlmer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-11T22:12:16Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T22:12:16Z","body":"So how are you supposed to use multi-threading without hanging the UI? When I add ```my_thread.wait_to_finish() ``` it hangs the UI even though it should be a different thread.  Also will the documentation be updated to include a list of all of the warning ids?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2537305839/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2537321049","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100291#issuecomment-2537321049","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100291","id":2537321049,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XPHJZ","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-11T22:20:29Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T22:20:29Z","body":"> So how are you supposed to use multi-threading without hanging the UI? When I add `my_thread.wait_to_finish() ` it hangs the UI even though it should be a different thread. Also will the documentation be updated to include a list of all of the warning ids?\n\nTo avoid stalls you should check if it's complete before waiting for it to finish. You can do that with [`is_task_completed`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_workerthreadpool.html#class-workerthreadpool-method-is-task-completed)\n\nI don't think we will ever document all the engine warnings. They tend to already explain themselves sufficiently. Like this one warns you that you didn't finish the thread before deleting and tells you that you should have called `wait_to_finish()`. I'm not sure if there would be value in putting that inside a list somewhere in the docs","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2537321049/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]